# Walking goes where the player looks: with the head turned 60 degrees, the left stick forward walks that way, and the
# body turns round to follow the head while it walks.
# Needs: Earth Planet (survival, on foot, in gravity).
plugin SpaceEngineersVR
world game:Earth Planet
log SpaceEngineersVR.log
expect session focused within 60

head 0 1.6 0
wait 2

# before: the head alone does not turn the body that far (60 degrees is past the 50 degree neck limit, so look at 30 first)
head 0 1.6 0 30
wait 1
read character
mark
wait 1
read character
expect forward moved < 0.05
expect no log (walking)

# head turned 60 degrees right, stick forward: the astronaut walks and its body comes round with the head
head 0 1.6 0 60
read character
mark
stick left 0 1
wait 1.5
stick left 0 0
wait 0.5
read character
expect position moved > 1.5
expect forward moved > 0.5
expect log (walking) within 5

cleanup
# Put back: the head ahead and a short walk, which turns the body all the way to the head, so the tests after this one
# start with the body facing where the head looks (standing still, the body stays up to 50 degrees off the head).
head 0 1.6 0
stick left 0 1
wait 0.5
stick left 0 0
wait 0.5
